direction: right

# 流程③ 安装需重启的 Plugin — 状态机
# actor: 主进程安装引擎(PluginInstaller)
# 零-fork 边界: 写 opencode.jsonc plugins[] + bun/npm install(镜像感知) + 提示重启
# 中国区弱网: npm 失败后自动切 npmmirror.com 重试

Idle: {
  shape: rectangle
  label: "空闲\nIdle"
}

Writing: {
  shape: rectangle
  label: "写 plugins[]\n到 opencode.jsonc\nWriting"
}

Installing: {
  shape: rectangle
  label: "bun install\n(primary registry)\nInstalling"
}

MirrorRetry: {
  shape: rectangle
  label: "npm 失败\n→ npmmirror 重试\nMirrorRetry"
  style.fill: "#fff3cd"
}

PendingRestart: {
  shape: rectangle
  label: "待重启\n(已写 config + 包)\nPendingRestart"
  style.fill: "#cce5ff"
}

Failed: {
  shape: rectangle
  label: "安装失败\n(已回滚 config)\nFailed"
  style.fill: "#f8d7da"
}

Idle -> Writing: 用户点「安装插件」\n→ window.api.ext.installPlugin(pkg)
Writing -> Installing: jsonc 写成功 + .bak 备份
Writing -> Failed: jsonc 写失败\n→ 提示"配置写入失败"
Installing -> PendingRestart: bun install 成功\n→ UI 显示"重启后生效"横幅
Installing -> MirrorRetry: npm/bun 超时或 403\n(检测到弱网或中国区)
MirrorRetry -> PendingRestart: npmmirror 安装成功
MirrorRetry -> Failed: 镜像也失败\n→ 回滚 jsonc(.bak 还原)\n→ 提示"网络问题+手动命令"
PendingRestart -> Idle: 用户点「立即重启」\n→ window.api.relaunch()
